          <zone h='34682' id='9' name='Reviews per day' w='32185' x='67200' y='24682'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='32700' id='10' name='E-money transaction value' w='50000' x='615' y='59859'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='32700' id='11' type-v2='text' w='48385' x='51000' y='59859'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f2d3d' fontsize='12'>What this means</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='10'>- The market is growing fast (transactions 3.9x, value 4.3x since 2021), so trust and reliability, not awareness, decide who wins.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='10'>- DANA gets the most reviews per day (20) and a 3.3 average: large, active, but 36% of its latest reviews are still 1 star.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='10'>- Apps are compared as equal-size snapshots of their latest 500 reviews. Those 500 reviews cover 25 days for DANA but 847 days for LinkAja, so no cross-app time trend is claimed.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
