    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='3 Priorities for DANA'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1300' minheight='800' minwidth='1300' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <datasources>
        <datasource name='Parameters' />
      </datasources>
      <datasource-dependencies datasource='Parameters'>
        <column caption='App' datatype='string' name='[Parameter 1]' param-domain-type='list' role='measure' type='nominal' value='&quot;All apps&quot;'>
          <calculation class='tableau' formula='&quot;All apps&quot;' />
          <members>
            <member value='&quot;All apps&quot;' />
            <member value='&quot;DANA&quot;' />
            <member value='&quot;GoPay&quot;' />
            <member value='&quot;OVO&quot;' />
            <member value='&quot;ShopeePay&quot;' />
            <member value='&quot;LinkAja&quot;' />
          </members>
        </column>
        <column caption='Reviews' datatype='string' name='[Parameter 2]' param-domain-type='list' role='measure' type='nominal' value='&quot;Latest 500&quot;'>
          <calculation class='tableau' formula='&quot;Latest 500&quot;' />
          <members>
            <member value='&quot;Latest 500&quot;' />
            <member value='&quot;Most helpful&quot;' />
          </members>
        </column>
      </datasource-dependencies>
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='31' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='10600' id='23' type-v2='text' w='98770' x='615' y='600'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f2d3d' fontsize='15'>DANA&apos;s standout problem is Paylater: 12.8% of its reviews vs 5.6% at peers</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#6b7785' fontsize='9'>DANA beats the peer average on failed transfers, customer service and login, but trails on Paylater and lost balance / auto-debit</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='7000' id='24' mode='compact' param='[Parameters].[Parameter 1]' type-v2='paramctrl' w='16000' x='615' y='11400'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='7000' id='25' mode='compact' param='[Parameters].[Parameter 2]' type-v2='paramctrl' w='16000' x='16800' y='11400'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='45400' id='26' name='Priority matrix' w='49000' x='615' y='18600'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='52600' id='27' name='DANA vs peers' w='49385' x='50000' y='11400'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='29000' id='28' name='DANA by app version' w='49000' x='615' y='64500'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='29000' id='29' type-v2='text' w='49385' x='50000' y='64500'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f2d3d' fontsize='12'>Recommendations for DANA</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='9'>1. DANA Cicil: users see a credit limit they cannot use. Show why and when it unlocks, in the app. Biggest gap vs peers (+7.3 pp).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='9'>2. Auto-debit and bills: confirm before each debit and send a receipt, to cut &apos;balance lost&apos; reviews (+2.0 pp vs peers; 90% of them are 1 star).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='9'>3. Watch release 2.145.0: rating fell to 3.05 from about 3.4, with more customer-service and fee complaints. Not yet significant (p = 0.10); track the next release.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#f4f6f8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='6000' id='30' type-v2='text' w='98770' x='615' y='93500'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#8a94a0' fontsize='8'>Sources: App Store public reviews, iOS Indonesia, 26 Sep 2026 (names not stored, personal data masked); Bank Indonesia Tabel 5e. Classifier precision 0.80 / recall 0.64 on 100 held-out hand labels. Independent analysis.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
